HTML APIs allow JavaScript to control browser features like audio, video, and graphics.
They help create interactive and dynamic web applications.
Common HTML APIs include Canvas, Geolocation, Web Storage, and Media APIs.
HTML APIs improve user experience without requiring external plugins.
